{"steam_appid":4659620,"steam_name":"Touhou Koumakyou: New Classic - the Embodiment of Scarlet Devil","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4659620/512535670/a30aea1dea528cc3f8eeb06465e9629e12ca118e/1788963101/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1788964892","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257420892/a63cac8d8e83a6847ac8d0d8db54862e68c1a7d9/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1788964892","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659620/b8bb6dc1814cab38c230d03ae4f29b3af71c7765/ss_b8bb6dc1814cab38c230d03ae4f29b3af71c7765.1920x1080.jpg?t=1788964897","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659620/d49125afee59296049544bd891227b0997436d28/ss_d49125afee59296049544bd891227b0997436d28.1920x1080.jpg?t=1788964897","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659620/7f29ee00ecacf99116e5cf8799faad500e7433b5/ss_7f29ee00ecacf99116e5cf8799faad500e7433b5.1920x1080.jpg?t=1788964897","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659620/93dd4cf3bd92db2168f8f66c8ac144ad9a65f91f/ss_93dd4cf3bd92db2168f8f66c8ac144ad9a65f91f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1788964897","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659620/1716ebe3e215f8ebd77a4b9169e967bdeb661e44/ss_1716ebe3e215f8ebd77a4b9169e967bdeb661e44.1920x1080.jpg?t=1788964897"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>*This title can only be purchased as part of a bundle. The price is the same, and the Classic version is included.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dodge the barrage, defeat enemies, and brave the Scarlet Mist incident.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Touhou Koumakyou - The Embodiment of Scarlet Devil, with music and graphics remastered by an older and wiser creator (self-described).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659620/extras/19588dfa332246a05c8c62d11483b053.gif?t=1788964897\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659620/extras/19588dfa332246a05c8c62d11483b053.poster.avif?t=1788964897\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659620/extras/d8b07d3656e06e603cb2b7658657ea9b.gif?t=1788964897\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659620/extras/d8b07d3656e06e603cb2b7658657ea9b.poster.avif?t=1788964897\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659620/extras/ad1b942627faece37c310008c3e79085.gif?t=1788964897\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659620/extras/ad1b942627faece37c310008c3e79085.poster.avif?t=1788964897\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Touhou Koumakyou - the Embodiment of Scarlet Devil</strong> is a vertical-scrolling 2D shoot-'em-up where you weave through dazzling curtains of bullets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of the shrine maiden Reimu or the magician Marisa, and set out to resolve the incident threatening Gensokyou. Dodge and slip your way forward through barrages of bullets dense enough to fill the entire screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659620/extras/f8b99effb8113f8dbe82460bf13e5b10.poster.avif?t=1788964897\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659620/extras/f8b99effb8113f8dbe82460bf13e5b10.webm?t=1788964897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659620/extras/f8b99effb8113f8dbe82460bf13e5b10.mp4?t=1788964897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make full use of each character's unique shots to defeat your enemies—while keeping your life count from dropping to zero under their attacks. Every shot type plays differently: some automatically home in on enemies, while others deliver superior firepower in a head-on assault.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659620/extras/fc88db1259fbc8f8b16c3b6283122846.poster.avif?t=1788964897\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659620/extras/fc88db1259fbc8f8b16c3b6283122846.webm?t=1788964897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659620/extras/fc88db1259fbc8f8b16c3b6283122846.mp4?t=1788964897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659620/extras/1c6f6dc0f689dc27797ae3f8afc749af.poster.avif?t=1788964897\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659620/extras/1c6f6dc0f689dc27797ae3f8afc749af.webm?t=1788964897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659620/extras/1c6f6dc0f689dc27797ae3f8afc749af.mp4?t=1788964897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The New Classic edition features upscaled high-resolution graphics, with every track rearranged by ZUN.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > It also adds a brand-new mode where you can take on the challenge with unlimited lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659620/extras/714d32a4499ed25fe68f89dd90981598.poster.avif?t=1788964897\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659620/extras/714d32a4499ed25fe68f89dd90981598.webm?t=1788964897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659620/extras/714d32a4499ed25fe68f89dd90981598.mp4?t=1788964897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Player movement: Move up, down, left, and right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Shot: Your standard attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Bomb: A special attack. The type can be chosen during character select, and each has its own characteristics, so pick your favorite and have fun. It's a very powerful attack, but be careful—the number of uses is limited.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Focus Mode: Slow your movement speed for finer control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gamepad button assignments can be changed via the Key Config in the game's Options menu.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gensokyou has been blanketed in a scarlet mist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hakurei Shrine maiden, Reimu Hakurei, and Marisa Kirisame, a magician living in the Forest of Magic, set out to resolve the incident.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She awaited them inside the Western-style mansion that materialized amidst the mist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Players</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reimu Hakurei</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659620/extras/db1b7b3a2675cef5d64938427cc3fcfb.avif?t=1788964897\" width=150 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The shrine maiden of the Hakurei Shrine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fights using high evasion capabilities and a wide attack range.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Marisa Kirisame</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659620/extras/57252df6671465cd8007e1c0c7aaa6b6.avif?t=1788964897\" width=180 height=149 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A magician living in the Forest of Magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenges the incident with a combat style specialized in high firepower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also play the Classic version, which recreates the original 2002 gameplay as closely as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*All text in the Classic version is in Japanese.</p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows10 / 11 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> core i5 8350U<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> UHD-Graphics-620<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Indie"],"developers":["上海アリス幻樂団","上海アリスReprise"],"publishers":["Alliance Arts"],"release_date":"9 Sep, 2026"}